OL,3,GNEWSAWoman jailed for role in
OL,4,Aprostitution ring
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman who was part of an organised
OL,7,Fcrime group that trafficked women into
OL,8,Fthe country for prostitution has been
OL,9,Fjailed.
OL,11,FLeicestershire Police said Wai Sin was
OL,12,Fpart of a group that moved victims from
OL,13,Fbrothel to brothel - with a premises in
OL,14,FLeicester "one hub on the carousel".
OL,16,FThe force said the "operation was like
OL,17,Fa conveyor belt, delivering a steady
OL,18,Fstream of women to Leicester to have
OL,19,Fsex with men for money".
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
